{"id":"090248243ce0b1ed","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/637_量化命题时序逻辑_QPTL.md","title":"637 量化命题时序逻辑 QPTL","display":"637_量化命题时序逻辑_QPTL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pfresh}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\to\\mathsf{Prop},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pfresh}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\to\\mathsf{Prop},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pfresh}(X)=p_m\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pfresh}(X)=p_m\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:p_i\\notin X\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:p_i\\notin X\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{until},\\operatorname{existsP}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{until},\\operatorname{existsP}\\)</span>。显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"XA\">\\(XA\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,U\\,B\">\\(A\\,U\\,B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists p\\,A\">\\(\\exists p\\,A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>派生连接词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,U\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(A\\,U\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists p\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(\\exists p\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由与绑定命题变元\">3. 自由与绑定命题变元</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{637},\\operatorname{BV}_{637}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{637},\\operatorname{BV}_{637}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(\\exists p\\,A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(\\exists p\\,A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变元函数的全部递归子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(XA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(XA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(\\exists p\\,A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(\\exists p\\,A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这七条覆盖全部原始构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-无捕获命题替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">4. 无捕获命题替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义类型化无捕获替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{637}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{637}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{637}(A,p,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{637}(A,p,B)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=B]\">\\(A[p:=B]\\)</span>。子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(q)[p:=B]=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{atom}(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(q)[p:=B]=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{atom}(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[p:=B]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[p:=B]=\\neg(A[p:=B]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[p:=B]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[p:=B]=\\neg(A[p:=B]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\to C[p:=B],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\to C[p:=B],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(XA)[p:=B]=X(A[p:=B]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(XA)[p:=B]=X(A[p:=B]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\,U\\,C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\,U\\,C[p:=B],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\,U\\,C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\,U\\,C[p:=B],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists q\\,A)[p:=B]=\\exists q\\,A\\quad\\text{若 }q=p,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists q\\,A)[p:=B]=\\exists q\\,A\\quad\\text{若 }q=p,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists q\\,A)[p:=B]=\\exists q\\,(A[p:=B])\\quad\\text{若 }q\\ne p\\text{ 且 }q\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists q\\,A)[p:=B]=\\exists q\\,(A[p:=B])\\quad\\text{若 }q\\ne p\\text{ 且 }q\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\ne p\">\\(q\\ne p\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B)\">\\(q\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B)\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=\\operatorname{pfresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B)\\cup\\{p,q\\})\">\\(r=\\operatorname{pfresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(B)\\cup\\{p,q\\})\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists q\\,A)[p:=B]=\\exists r\\,((A[q:=\\operatorname{atom}(r)])[p:=B]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists q\\,A)[p:=B]=\\exists r\\,((A[q:=\\operatorname{atom}(r)])[p:=B]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>先定义 fresh 重命名生成关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ren}_{637}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\exists p\\,A,\\exists q\\,(A[p:=\\operatorname{atom}(q)])):\np,q\\in\\mathsf{Prop},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},\nq\\notin(\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\})\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ren}_{637}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\exists p\\,A,\\exists q\\,(A[p:=\\operatorname{atom}(q)])):\np,q\\in\\mathsf{Prop},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},\nq\\notin(\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\})\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}\\)</span> 是所有构造子相容等价关系中包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ren}_{637}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ren}_{637}\\)</span> 的最小等价关系；等价地，它包含下列每个重命名对：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists p\\,A\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}\\exists q\\,(A[p:=\\operatorname{atom}(q)])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists p\\,A\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}\\exists q\\,(A[p:=\\operatorname{atom}(q)])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\">\\(q\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{637}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\notin\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\">\\(q\\notin\\operatorname{BV}_{637}(A)\\)</span>。也就是说，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\to,X,U,\\exists\">\\(\\neg,\\to,X,U,\\exists\\)</span> 均闭合，并且只由绑定命题变元的 fresh 重命名生成。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 分配、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 固定点和量词公理为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{637}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{637}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{637}=\\{(A\\,U\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land X(A\\,U\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{637}=\\{(A\\,U\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land X(A\\,U\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{QDist}^{637}=\\{\\exists p(A\\lor B)\\to(\\exists p A\\lor\\exists p B):p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{QDist}^{637}=\\{\\exists p(A\\lor B)\\to(\\exists p A\\lor\\exists p B):p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{QInst}^{637}=\\{A[p:=B]\\to\\exists p A:p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{QInst}^{637}=\\{A[p:=B]\\to\\exists p A:p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{637}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{637}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{637}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{637}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{637}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{637}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{637}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{637}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{QDist}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{QInst}^{637}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{637}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{637}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{QDist}^{637}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{QInst}^{637}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{637}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{637}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{637}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{637}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{GenQ}^{637}=\\{((A),\\exists p A):p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{GenQ}^{637}=\\{((A),\\exists p A):p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Alpha}^{637}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},A\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Alpha}^{637}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},A\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{637}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{637}\\)</span> 为四者并。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义证明对象函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{637}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{637})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{\\substack{m\\in\\mathbb N\\\\m&gt;0}}\n(\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{637})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{637})^m\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{637}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{637})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{\\substack{m\\in\\mathbb N\\\\m&gt;0}}\n(\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{637})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{637})^m\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{637}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{637}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 由所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{637}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{637}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=XA_j\">\\(A_i=XA_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\exists p\\,A_j\">\\(A_i=\\exists p\\,A_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,637}A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{637}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{637}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{637}(\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{637}(\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\Delta_{m-1}\\subseteq\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_{m-1}=A\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\Delta_{m-1}\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{637}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{637}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{637}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{637}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>QPTL 的目标差异是命题量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists p\">\\(\\exists p\\)</span> 绑定命题变元，故自由变元、无捕获替换、fresh 选择与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价都是系统对象。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-二阶命题迹结构\">10. 二阶命题迹结构</h1>\n<p>定义迹集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题集合量化域定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PVal}_{637}=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PVal}_{637}=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathsf{PVal}_{637}\">\\(S\\in\\mathsf{PVal}_{637}\\)</span>，定义重赋值迹</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu[p:=S]\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu[p:=S]\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\nu[p:=S](i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(q=p\\wedge i\\in S\\bigr)\n\\qquad\\text{或}\\qquad\n\\bigl(q\\ne p\\wedge q\\in\\nu(i)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q\\in\\nu[p:=S](i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(q=p\\wedge i\\in S\\bigr)\n\\qquad\\text{或}\\qquad\n\\bigl(q\\ne p\\wedge q\\in\\nu(i)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-满足关系\">11. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{637}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{637}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的最小关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{637}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{637}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{637}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{637}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{637}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{637}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}XA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k+1\\Vdash_{637}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}XA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k+1\\Vdash_{637}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}A\\,U\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k\\le j\\wedge\\nu,j\\Vdash_{637}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N\\,(k\\le h&lt;j\\to\\nu,h\\Vdash_{637}A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}A\\,U\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k\\le j\\wedge\\nu,j\\Vdash_{637}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N\\,(k\\le h&lt;j\\to\\nu,h\\Vdash_{637}A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}\\exists p\\,A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{PVal}_{637}\\ \\nu[p:=S],k\\Vdash_{637}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}\\exists p\\,A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{PVal}_{637}\\ \\nu[p:=S],k\\Vdash_{637}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-语义后果\">12. 语义后果</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{637}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{637}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{637}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\Vdash_{637}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{637}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}:\\varnothing\\models_{637}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{637}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{637}:\\varnothing\\models_{637}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{QPTL}_{637}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},\\operatorname{FV}_{637},\\operatorname{BV}_{637},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{637},\\mathsf{Ren}_{637},\\equiv_{\\alpha,637},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{637},\\mathsf{Rule}_{637},\\mathsf{Proof}_{637},\\vdash_{637},\\mathsf{Thm}_{637}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{QPTL}_{637}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},\\operatorname{FV}_{637},\\operatorname{BV}_{637},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{637},\\mathsf{Ren}_{637},\\equiv_{\\alpha,637},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{637},\\mathsf{Rule}_{637},\\mathsf{Proof}_{637},\\vdash_{637},\\mathsf{Thm}_{637}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>扩展后的完整对象为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{QPTL}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{637}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},\\operatorname{FV}_{637},\\operatorname{BV}_{637},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{637},\\mathsf{Ren}_{637},\\equiv_{\\alpha,637},\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{637},\\mathsf{PVal}_{637},(\\nu,p,S)\\mapsto\\nu[p:=S],\\Vdash_{637},\\models_{637},\\mathsf{Val}_{637},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{637},\\mathsf{Rule}_{637},\\mathsf{Proof}_{637},\\vdash_{637},\\mathsf{Thm}_{637}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{QPTL}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{637}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{637},\\operatorname{FV}_{637},\\operatorname{BV}_{637},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{637},\\mathsf{Ren}_{637},\\equiv_{\\alpha,637},\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{637},\\mathsf{PVal}_{637},(\\nu,p,S)\\mapsto\\nu[p:=S],\\Vdash_{637},\\models_{637},\\mathsf{Val}_{637},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{637},\\mathsf{